&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Tavily&#39;s founding &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; in the UK, you&#39;ll own the full sales cycle across strategic enterprise accounts, from pipeline creation through close. You&#39;ll help define our go-to-market motion, establish our presence in the region, and work closely with leadership to shape the future of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; l

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architect, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Fireblocks, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform for securely moving, storing, and issuing digital assets, powered by the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based wallet infrastructure. As of January 2026 we serve over 2,400 institutional customers, have secured over $10 trillion in digital asset transfers, and are the world’s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about the opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solution Architect in our EMEA Professional Services team, you own the technical delivery of Fireblocks implementations for the region’s largest Banks and Financial Institutions. From deal close through to production, you lead architecture design, integration, and deployment on customer infrastructure. You also bring that delivery expertise into strategic pre-sales cycles,

&lt;p&gt;Datadog’s Implementation Services team helps customers implement and deploy Datadog quickly. Our team of architects leads the discovery, design, build, and launch of the Datadog platform to help customers accelerate time to value and get the most out of their investment. As a member of our team, you will be responsible for developing the technical roadmap for a customer’s implementation, and leading them through it every step of the way.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and guide execution of Datadog implementations, including gathering requirements, building technical architecture, and supporting deployment and launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customer onboarding through co-development working sessions and assist when they run into roadblocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write automation and design architecture for deployment templates&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the operation of implementation projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other teams, including Customer Success, Technical Account Management, and Sales to deliver an exceptional onboarding experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering technical solutions for DevOps Monitoring or architecture systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) and compute technologies (EC2, serverless, VMware, VMs, Docker, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Config Management, IAC and CI/CD tools, including Ansible, Puppet, Terraform, Chef, Jenkins, Circle CI, GitHub Actions, Azure Pipelines, etc…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every RELEX implementation is a solution built from scratch for one customer: their processes, their data, their targets. (Senior) Supply Chain Consultants shape both sides of that build — the business processes and KPIs the customer will run on, and the configuration that makes them work in the system. Depending on your background you will lean more towards one side than the other. This is a heavily customer-facing role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand how the customer really plans.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prepare, facilitate and document workshops to gather and specify business requirements, and run the data analysis that shows where the strengths and the gaps actually are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the target picture&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— planning processes, roles and the KPIs the project is measured on — and guide customers towards RELEX best practice, including where their current way of working needs to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build it.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configuration, business rules, workflows and reporting that deliver the design you just agreed, and that hold up in operation: nightly run performance, scalability and maintainability, not just functional correctness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make the value case tangible&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for customer leadership: define how forecast accuracy, availability, inventory and cost will be measured, and report honestly on where we stand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take it live.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nb

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Associate Director / Director, Data Strategy &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location: Remote&lt;/em&gt; — this is a remote, work-from-home role, as are all positions at Acceleration Partners. Some travel is required for client meetings, internal meetings, conferences, and industry events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director / Director, Data Strategy &amp;amp; Measurement is responsible for defining and leading Acceleration Partners&#39; data, analytics and measurement capability. This role sits at the intersection of client strategy, data science, measurement, AI-enabled insights and commercial growth. The Director will work directly with enterprise clients to understand their marketing and business data ecosystem, develop measurement strategies, and help clients make better decisions through data. Internally, the role will partner with Client Services, Strategy, Sales and AI Automation teams to build AP&#39;s data capability, improve decision-making, develop new services and products, and raise data literacy across the organization. As a senior leader, the Director will also develop AP&#39;s market position as a leading authority on affiliate, influencer and partnership measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Measurement &amp;amp; Data Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Serve as AP&#39;s senior advisor on measurement, analytics and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Understand client data ecosystems including affiliate networks, influencer platforms, Google Analytics, CRM systems, customer databases, MMM outputs and business intelligence tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design measurement frameworks that connect partnership marketing activity to broader business outcomes, spanning attribution, incrementality, customer acquisition and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
